{"parse": {"title": "3RD-14", "pageid": 6085, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/3RD-13\" title=\"3RD-13\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">3RD-14</span><a href=\"/wiki/3RD-15\" title=\"3RD-15\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">3RD</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">14</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.BF.B7.E9.80.94.E7.BE.94.E7.BE.8A\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"迷途羔羊\">迷途羔羊</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 迷途羔羊</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Lost Lambs</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>亲<span class=\"color-value\"></span>爱<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>那<span class=\"color-value\"></span>不<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>他<span class=\"color-value\"></span>们<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>错<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>孩<span class=\"color-value\"></span>子<span class=\"color-value\"></span>们<span class=\"color-value\"></span>只<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>需<span class=\"color-value\"></span>要<span class=\"color-value\"></span>正<span class=\"color-value\"></span>确<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>指<span class=\"color-value\"></span>引<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 10314</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"gaocengbangongshi\"><img alt=\"gaocengbangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png/600px-Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png/900px-Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>这几天辛苦你了，小梅斯梅尔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>照看那些受“暴雨”刺激的病人很不容易吧？很抱歉让你在这么小的年纪就经受了这些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>你是梅斯梅尔家族的继承人，我们两方合作的历史已经太久远了。我相信你能承受得住……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>这“暴雨”的真相。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>……他们……都是疯子……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>他们曾经是与我们一样的正常人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>不要责怪他们。他们只是在未做好准备前就看到了真相。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>不是每个人都能像你一样坚强的，小梅斯梅尔。我们还有许多的病人，需要你的治疗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>……我会努力的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>对了，我们在你的储物柜里发现了这些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她抬了抬手，那是一张涂有笔记的地图。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>你介不介意我们替你保管？上面似乎是你朋友的最新计划。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>维尔汀……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>请帮帮他们吧，他们还不知道……他们不知道到底发生了什么……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>不要再让他们做危险的事情了……呜呜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>那是当然，职责所在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>你先回去吧，好好保重身体。说不定，过几天还会有新的病人需要你的帮助呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>谢谢您告诉了我这些……谢谢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她哽咽着离开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>康斯坦丁拿着手中的棋子，静静地望着窗外。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>屋内的另一扇门被推开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>白色的人影疾步走上前来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-501211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-501211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-501211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>这次“暴雨”的时间，问出来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>重塑他们预测是在本月二十七日晚上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>康斯坦丁转过来，黑暗中的笑容似乎发着光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>你看，我说的吧。对付重塑的俘虏，比起恐吓……更有效的，永远是利益与爱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>感谢我们的前线侦察兵，不仅找到了指挥奥利图欧的场所，还抓来了重塑的俘虏。这下维尔汀这边的难题也得以解决了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>“越狱行动”二十号进行……他们为什么要选择这个时间……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>噢。我明白了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>你想到了什么吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>Z女士也走到桌旁，低头看着地图。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>我们现在还不知道哪些学生参与了这个行动。但我们可以在那一天驻守在瞭望塔附近，拦住这群迷途的羔羊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>不，呵呵……亲爱的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>把视察学校的时间推迟到二十六日。要求所有人都严阵以待。二十六日后，瞭望塔各撤下一个人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>同时，换掉女生宿舍通往医务室的防空大门，材质选用含铅化合物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>部分基金会的伤员转移到学校的医务室内。医务室附近需要二十四小时有人驻守。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>这些是……我不明白，而且铅根本不适合造门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>呵呵，你怎么还不明白？这张地图是重塑投掷下来的。他们一定在东南瞭望塔外等着接应。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>我决不可能把基金会培养的学生们拱手让人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>他们能且只能——按照我所规划的时间和路线离开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>离开？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>按你规定的路线……二十六号的后一天……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>你想……难道你想的是——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>实现他们的心愿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>是时候让他们亲眼见证“暴雨”了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>为什么！我们不能这么做——这样、这样太残酷了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>你有没有想过他们离开学校边界的时候……有可能就是“暴雨”来临的时候？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>除了维尔汀，所有人都会被回溯掉！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>呵呵……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>——不，你想过。你期待的正是这个……是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>我们已经别无他路了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>我们的保护，对他们来说，是强权的欺瞒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>没有什么能阻止猜忌的生长。别忘了，重塑也在一旁虎视眈眈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>如果一些顺水推舟的牺牲，就能换来维尔汀的忠诚，谁还会在乎最初的那一步后翼弃兵？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>她是独一无二的人才。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>我从1999那一年……就在期望她的成长。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>为此，我需要她牢记背叛的代价。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>你还有什么疑问吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>如果没有什么问题，你可以开始行动了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>了解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她卷起图纸，退后了两步。灰暗的灯光下，几乎看不清她的神情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>但我永远，永远也不会认同这次的计划。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>因为你不懂政治。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>是的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>真遗憾，我只是个科学家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"3000101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bd/Empty_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"3000101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" data-file-width=\"2\" data-file-height=\"2\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>计划有变。紧急通知，计划有变！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "3RD-14"}}